# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit {#introduction-to-qiskit}"
msgstr "Panimula sa Qiskit {#introduction-to-qiskit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The name \"Qiskit\" is a general term referring to a collection of software for executing programs on quantum computers. Most notable among these software tools is the open-source Qiskit SDK, and the runtime environment, accessed using IBM Quantum Compute Service (formerly known as the Qiskit Runtime Service), through which you can execute workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs). As quantum technology evolves, so does Qiskit, with new capabilities released every year that expand this core collection of quantum software.\n"
msgstr "Ang pangalang \"Qiskit\" ay pangkalahatang termino para sa koleksyon ng software na ginagamit sa pagpapatakbo ng mga program sa mga quantum computer. Pinakakilala sa mga software tool na ito ang open-source na Qiskit SDK, at ang runtime environment, na ina-access gamit ang IBM Quantum Compute Service (dating kilala bilang Qiskit Runtime Service), kung saan puwede kang magpatakbo ng mga workload sa IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs). Habang umuunlad ang quantum technology, umuunlad din ang Qiskit, na may mga bagong kakayahang inilalabas taon-taon na nagpapalawak sa pangunahing koleksyon na ito ng quantum software.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition, many open-source projects are part of the broader Qiskit ecosystem. These software tools are not part of Qiskit itself, but rather interface with Qiskit and can provide valuable additional functionality.\n"
msgstr "Bukod dito, maraming open-source na proyekto ang bahagi ng mas malawak na Qiskit ecosystem. Hindi bahagi ng Qiskit mismo ang mga software tool na ito, ngunit nakikipag-interface sa Qiskit at maaaring magbigay ng mahahalagang karagdagang functionality.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM is committed to the responsible development of quantum computing. Learn more and review our responsible quantum principles in the [Responsible quantum computing](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/responsible-quantum-computing) topic.\n"
msgstr "Nakatuon ang IBM sa responsableng pagpapaunlad ng quantum computing. Alamin pa at basahin ang aming responsible quantum principles sa paksang [Responsible quantum computing](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/responsible-quantum-computing).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK {#the-qiskit-sdk}"
msgstr "Ang Qiskit SDK {#the-qiskit-sdk}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK (package name [`qiskit`](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/)) is an open-source SDK for working with quantum computers at the level of extended (static, dynamic, and scheduled) quantum circuits, operators, and primitives. This library is the core component of Qiskit; it is the largest package under the Qiskit name with the broadest suite of tools for quantum computation, and many other components interface with it.\n"
msgstr "Ang Qiskit SDK (pangalan ng package: [`qiskit`](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/)) ay isang open-source na SDK para sa pagtatrabaho sa mga quantum computer sa antas ng extended (static, dynamic, at scheduled) na quantum circuit, operator, at primitive. Ang library na ito ang pangunahing bahagi ng Qiskit; ito ang pinakamalaking package sa ilalim ng pangalang Qiskit na may pinakamalawak na suite ng mga tool para sa quantum computation, at maraming ibang bahagi ang nakikipag-interface dito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some of the most useful features of the Qiskit SDK include:\n"
msgstr "Ilan sa mga pinakakapaki-pakinabang na feature ng Qiskit SDK ay ang:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit-building tools** ([`qiskit.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit)) - For initializing and manipulating registers, circuits, instructions, gates, parameters, and control flow objects.\n"
msgstr "**Mga tool sa pagbuo ng Circuit** ([`qiskit.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit)) - Para sa pag-initialize at pag-manipulate ng mga register, circuit, instruction, gate, parameter, at control flow object.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit library** ([`qiskit.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library)) - A vast range of circuits, instructions, and gates - key building blocks for circuit-based quantum computations.\n"
msgstr "**Circuit library** ([`qiskit.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library)) - Malawak na hanay ng mga circuit, instruction, at gate - mga pangunahing building block para sa circuit-based na quantum computation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Quantum info library** ([`qiskit.quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info)) - A toolkit for working with quantum states, operators and channels, using exact calculations (no sampling noise). Use this module to specify input observables and analyze fidelity of outputs from primitives queries.\n"
msgstr "**Quantum info library** ([`qiskit.quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info)) - Toolkit para sa pagtatrabaho sa mga quantum state, operator, at channel, gamit ang eksaktong kalkulasyon (walang sampling noise). Gamitin ang module na ito para tukuyin ang mga input observable at suriin ang fidelity ng mga output mula sa primitives query.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Transpiler** ([`qiskit.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler)) - For transforming and adapting quantum circuits to suit specific device topology, and optimizing for execution on real quantum processing units (QPUs).\n"
msgstr "**Transpiler** ([`qiskit.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler)) - Para sa pag-transform at pag-angkop ng mga quantum circuit sa partikular na device topology, at pag-optimize para sa pagpapatakbo sa mga totoong quantum processing unit (QPUs).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Primitives** ([`qiskit.primitives`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/primitives)) - The module that contains the base definitions and reference implementations of the Sampler and Estimator primitives, from which different quantum hardware providers can derive their own implementations. See more information about the IBM Quantum primitives [in the documentation](/guides/qiskit-runtime-primitives).\n"
msgstr "**Primitives** ([`qiskit.primitives`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/primitives)) - Ang module na naglalaman ng mga base definition at reference implementation ng mga Sampler at Estimator primitive, na pinagmumulan ng iba't ibang quantum hardware provider para gumawa ng sarili nilang implementation. Tingnan ang karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa IBM Quantum primitives [sa dokumentasyon](/guides/qiskit-runtime-primitives).\n"

