msgstr "Para sa mas detalyadong panimula sa pag-install ng Qiskit SDK, tingnan ang [pahina ng pag-install](/guides/install-qiskit). Kung handa ka nang mag-install ngayon, patakbuhin lang ang:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarking {#benchmarking}"
msgstr "Benchmarking {#benchmarking}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarking is important for comparing the relative performance of quantum software across different stages of a development workflow. Benchmarking tests for quantum software might, for example, look at the speed and quality of building, manipulating, and transpiling circuits. IBM Quantum is committed to delivering the most performant SDK possible, and to that end, the Qiskit SDK is benchmarked using over 1,000 tests developed by leading universities, national labs, and researchers at IBM. The benchmarking suite used for these tests, named Benchpress, is now available as [an open-source package](https://github.com/qiskit/benchpress). You can now use the Benchpress package to perform your own analysis of quantum SDK performance.\n"
msgstr "Mahalaga ang benchmarking para ihambing ang relatibong performance ng quantum software sa iba't ibang yugto ng development workflow. Halimbawa, maaaring tingnan ng mga benchmarking test para sa quantum software ang bilis at kalidad ng pagbuo, pag-manipulate, at pag-transpile ng mga circuit. Nakatuon ang IBM Quantum sa paghahatid ng pinaka-performant na SDK na posible, at para rito, ang Qiskit SDK ay sinusukat gamit ang mahigit 1,000 test na binuo ng mga nangungunang unibersidad, pambansang laboratoryo, at mga mananaliksik sa IBM. Ang benchmarking suite na ginamit para sa mga test na ito, na pinangalanang Benchpress, ay available na ngayon bilang [open-source na package](https://github.com/qiskit/benchpress). Puwede mo na ngayong gamitin ang Benchpress package para magsagawa ng sarili mong pagsusuri sa performance ng quantum SDK.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Learn about the library of circuits and instructions available in the Qiskit [circuit library](/guides/circuit-library).\n"
"  - Read about the Qiskit transpiler and the many options for transpilation in the [Transpiler](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"  - Find out how to use the [primitive interface](/guides/primitives) to streamline quantum programming.\n"
"  - Check out the [Qiskit ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) which hosts open-source projects interfacing and extending the functionality of Qiskit\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  - Alamin ang tungkol sa library ng mga circuit at instruction na available sa Qiskit [circuit library](/guides/circuit-library).\n"
"  - Basahin ang tungkol sa Qiskit transpiler at sa maraming opsyon para sa transpilation sa seksyong [Transpiler](/guides/transpile).\n"
"  - Alamin kung paano gamitin ang [primitive interface](/guides/primitives) para pasimplehin ang quantum programming.\n"
"  - Tingnan ang [Qiskit ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) na nagho-host ng mga open-source na proyektong nakikipag-interface at nagpapalawak ng functionality ng Qiskit\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
